            "heading": "Where do you ship?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We ship all over the world! Wherever you are, we're planning to conquer cities globally - just like our comic vision. Your package can find its way to you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TYHAUf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When will my package arrive?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Delivery times vary by region:</p><ul><li><strong>Europe</strong>: 5-10 business days</li><li><strong>UK</strong>: 7-12 business days</li><li><strong>North America</strong>: 10-15 business days</li><li><strong>Asia</strong>: 12-20 business days</li><li><strong>Rest of the world</strong>: 15-25 business days</li></ul><p>We're not The Flash, but we hustle! Each package is wrapped with love and sent with joy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cFiirg": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I track my order?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>After we ship, you'll get a tracking number via email. You can follow where your package is traveling - almost like a comic book adventure! If something's unclear, just message us.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xniPrN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What payment methods do you accept?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We accept all major card payments including <strong>Visa, Mastercard, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Revolut</strong>, as well as <strong>PayPal</strong> and bank transfers. All payments are processed securely through trusted providers. Whatever works best for you - we're flexible.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_QFyzcr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is online payment secure?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. All transactions are protected with SSL encryption and handled by certified, secure payment gateways. Your data is safe with us.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ghanX9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your return policy?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Changed your mind? No worries! You have <strong>14 days</strong> to return unopened items. Just reach out at <a href=\"mailto:support@walterin.com\">support@walterin.com</a> and we'll guide you through it. We want you to love what you get - if not, let's make it right.</p><p></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_kBwdkK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I reach customer support?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Shoot us an email at <a href=\"mailto:support@walterin.com\">support@walterin.com</a> or DM us on Instagram <strong>@walterinwittyguide</strong>. We're real humans who actually care, not bots. Usually respond within 24 hours (sometimes faster if we're caffeinated ☕).</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
